mambagir/_mambavision.py contains architecture definitions extracted from
the supplied MambaVision source, originally developed by NVIDIA Corporation.
Upstream: https://github.com/NVlabs/MambaVision
License: Nvidia Source Code License-NC; complete text is provided in
licenses/NVIDIA-MambaVision.txt. Its research/evaluation-only use limitation
continues to apply to the extracted architecture and derivative works.
Original NVIDIA copyright and attribution notices are retained in the file.

Local modifications: retain only the required architecture classes; remove
model registration, automatic downloads and unused experimental factories;
make attention dropout follow evaluation mode. The source remains compatible
with the corresponding checkpoint parameter names.

Datasets, pretrained MambaVision/Mamba weights, and third-party packages are
not distributed here and retain their respective licenses.

The release's trained visual encoder states build upon the NVIDIA
MambaVision-B-21K pretrained weights (Hatamizadeh and Kautz, CVPR 2025).
Upstream: https://github.com/NVlabs/MambaVision
The upstream pretrained weights are licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
